 that there's a lot of other  scenes with a lot of other characters  that are going to be filming first and  that could mean that there could be  multiple villains in spider-man 3 since  so much filming has to happen before Tom  Holland actually gets there and this  could potentially mean and I want to  stress that this is pure speculation on  my part but it could potentially mean  that we could see the sinister six and  spider-man 3 it's been rumored for a  while now and if they are filming  multiple villains it just makes sense  now recently Marissa Tomei who of course  plays Aunt May and Captain America Civil  War  spider-man homecoming and spider-man  fight from home has opened up a little  bit about what to expect from Aunt May  in spider-man 3 while talking to Screen  Rant for her new film the king of Staten  Island she was asked about what  spider-man 3 will hold for on May and  although of course she couldn't reveal  much about the film she was able to  share her hopes for Aunt May story arc  in spider-man 3 and in the interview she  said well I've had her director John  watts and I have always talked about her  being a community organizer and  hopefully that track will expand and be  a part of this one as well now a  community organizer in spider-man 3  where Peter Parker is a wanted criminal  could mean that she's going to go around  in the community and get people to  believe that spider-man is actually  innocent they know who Peter Parker is  so they're gonna know that Aunt May is  his aunt so of course the authorities  are going to talk to her but of course  she's going to claim that he's innocent  and it sounds like she's going to get  the community involved the spider-man  community that believes spider-man is  good and get them involved and get them  all to try and help proof that he is  actually innocent so just a little  tidbit about what we can expect from  Aunt May's character so a lot of  exciting things happening with  spider-man we have a  new spider-man Miles Morales ps5 game  coming out and for those of you who have  been asking it yes I will stream it  along with the Avengers game when they  come out  production on spider-man into the spider  verse 2 has been announced and  production on spider-man 3 is going to  pick back up again in September or  October so let me know what you think  about this news in the comments down  below don't forget to like the video and  subscribe so you can stay up to date on  everything relating to spider-man and of  course the MCU for live updates you can  follow me on Twitter and as always thank  you all so much for watching  woof woof
 

